{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE WAVES OF DEADLY SLIMES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449900/extras/4d253c2690cf1e401954ebed5140b126.poster.avif?t=1754489175\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449900/extras/4d253c2690cf1e401954ebed5140b126.webm?t=1754489175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449900/extras/4d253c2690cf1e401954ebed5140b126.mp4?t=1754489175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Slime Squisher, your main goal is to protect a strawberry by squishing  slimes with your cursor. The slimes come in a variety of sizes and shapes. Some are fast, some are slow, some shoot bullets, and some are big and bulky!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COLLECT COINS AND PURCHASE UPGRADES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449900/extras/b040e1141e22fc41d6895e19d77cdf31.poster.avif?t=1754489175\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449900/extras/b040e1141e22fc41d6895e19d77cdf31.webm?t=1754489175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449900/extras/b040e1141e22fc41d6895e19d77cdf31.mp4?t=1754489175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slimes have a small chance to drop gold coins. These coins can be spent on permanent upgrades which will make you more powerful on your next run!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNLEASH CHAOS ONTO THE SLIMES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449900/extras/96f46509199d55a423a512df04953d87.poster.avif?t=1754489175\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449900/extras/96f46509199d55a423a512df04953d87.webm?t=1754489175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449900/extras/96f46509199d55a423a512df04953d87.mp4?t=1754489175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect your strawberry at all cost! With each wave, you\u2019ll grow stronger and eventually\u00a0 unleash total chaos onto the slimes!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHALLENGES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449900/extras/cc65b510cb28d9a634680d0a8b0bb441.poster.avif?t=1754489175\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449900/extras/cc65b510cb28d9a634680d0a8b0bb441.webm?t=1754489175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449900/extras/cc65b510cb28d9a634680d0a8b0bb441.mp4?t=1754489175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slime Squisher has a variety of different gamemodes to be played, some are more challenging than others. Create your own build by combining different upgrades.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regular gamemode: Easy, normal and hard difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meta progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Active abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And a lot of squished slimes!</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Easy completed!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3449900/9ddc3ae48fc7cd3cf038d6be415dc3322b4e0800.jpg"},{"name":"Normal completed!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3449900/1765cf5d09e913cbada49dd39d73b50561e11c3b.jpg"},{"name":"Hard completed!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3449900/37f0d8172e05b665374f80bb91032b46253c8634.jpg"},{"name":"Bullethell completed!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3449900/1aaae023355b8de82494791217af8ea2c2c2f6a3.jpg"},{"name":"Flash completed!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3449900/aa690419d952a4f37d0ec16bd4e528a069687b45.jpg"},{"name":"Rampage completed!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3449900/4c52caf704071bf8df01f005d62e399f02ed8e3b.jpg"},{"name":"7/7 \u2705","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3449900/14bee718cba60b18e04e240a48eae8c961213ef4.jpg"},{"name":"No damage!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3449900/0fd7382a6503d45c3d7498f245efe7866d0cfafe.jpg"},{"name":"Punchy clicks!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3449900/aafa0429b8b43b0eb91418f6bf52e122c3cbb650.jpg"},{"name":"Clover!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3449900/fe8022d68f02488b7913b2fb1233ba42de012b92.jpg"}],"total":28},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3449900?t=1754489175","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3